      "text": {
        "jp": "……オレが何者か、だって？\r\nそんなに知りたきゃ、教えてやるぜ！",
        "official_en": "Identify myself...? Well if you’re so keen to know who I am, I suppose I shall indulge you!",
        "real_en": "...You want to know who I am? If you're that curious, I'll tell you!"
      },
