      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ、ちょっと古い気もするが\r\n由緒正しい武具に違いない。\r\n思わぬ収穫だな。",
        "official_en": "Indeed, though it looks a little worse for wear... It appears to be some kind of heirloom. A welcome windfall indeed.",
        "real_en": "Yeah. It looks a little old, but it must be a fine piece of equipment with a long history. What an unexpected find."
