      "text": {
        "jp": "その「源氏の小手」は武芸を極めた者の武具。\r\nお前たちには、もったいないぜ！",
        "official_en": "Only the mightiest of mighty have the right to don those Genji Gloves! They’ll be wasted on scrawny knaves such as you two!",
        "real_en": "Those Genji Gloves belong to a master of martial arts! They're wasted on the likes of you!"
